<p>Lloyds TSB	    YR     PFT	2455	 2410-2480    1650</p>
<p>			 DIV	12.7	 12.6-13.0    25.1</p>
<p>				   EPS	30.0	 28.7-305     11.0</p>
<p>    **    Current cost net income excluding special items.</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
